x-capture-core-client (G6)

No hot file needs a line from this task: capture-window.ts registers its own host handlers and the core port open
channel, and creates its relay with createCaptureRelay (capture-core.ts).

Delete (not owned by this task, tests the removed fake host):
  apps/desktop/src/main/capture-new-task.test.mjs
    It imports CaptureService from capture-host.ts, which no longer exists: the capture window's new task is a real
    thread on the capture core now.

The capture harness must give the capture process MIXDOGD_BIN (the built mixdogd with its js-runtime.json beside it,
as scripts/live/lib/instance.mjs prepareCore stages it); startCaptureCore refuses to start without it.
